process mean_4⦅tensor⟨float64⟩⟬4⟭ x⦆ → float64 ⟦
    float64 s ↦ ∑ x ·
    yield s ⊘ 4.0 ·
⟧

process variance_4⦅tensor⟨float64⟩⟬4⟭ x⦆ → float64 ⟦
    float64 m ↦ mean_4⦅x⦆ ·
    tensor⟨float64⟩⟬4⟭ dev ↦ x ⊖ m ·
    tensor⟨float64⟩⟬4⟭ sq ↦ dev ⊗ dev ·
    float64 sum_sq ↦ ∑ sq ·
    yield sum_sq ⊘ 4.0 ·
⟧

